        "text": "**Initiating Python Script Creation**\n\nI'm now implementing the first Python file, `summarize_text.py`, leveraging Google's LLM for text summarization. Simultaneously, I've created placeholder files to ensure all 10 Python files are ready as planned.\n\n\n**Developing Core Script Functions**\n\nI'm focusing on `summarize_text.py`, integrating `gemini-pro`. The structure involves importing from and utilizing `model_client.py` and `model_models.py`, which are also being set up. My current focus is implementing the `summarize_text` function to interact with the LLM via `get_gemini_model`. I am currently working on defining the structures of `model_client.py`, and `model_models.py`. The remaining files are in the process of being prepared as placeholder files.\n\n\n",
